# One text convention for the whole repo: LF in the working tree on every
# platform, including Windows checkouts.
#
# This is load-bearing for CI, not cosmetics. The C# suite golden-compares
# fixture *bytes* — SchemaGoldenTests reads
# fixtures/schemas/sample-host.ddl.sql with File.ReadAllBytes and compares
# it to generated DDL that uses "\n" — and Windows runners default to
# core.autocrlf=true. Without this rule the windows leg of ci.yml fails on
# line endings alone, with no defect behind it.
#
# `text=auto` still detects binary content and leaves it alone;
# fixtures/delivery/.gitattributes opts the signature-bearing envelopes out
# entirely (its comment already assumed this file existed).
* text=auto eol=lf
